  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstDayFinish
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstDayFinish
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - Now that your work here is done for the day, the museum will stay open for 8
    hours. During this time, visitors will come and go, leaving donations to the
    cause depending on the level of interest they have in the showcased works.
  - You're free to clock out whenever you'd like! In order to stay on schedule, all
    tasks must be completed within 24 hours of initially clocking in. Once the museum
    is open, new cards won't be delivered until it closes again, after 8 hours.
  - You can clock in and out whenever you'd like during your tasks - and the museum
    will automatically remember your progress!
  - Just keep in mind, taking a day off will reset your curation streak! For the
    best results, try to make a habit out of clocking in every day - your memory
    - and us spren - will thank you for it!
  - I'll be back tomorrow to explain some more parts of the job - but thanks for
    the great work today! You'll be a master curator in no time at all.
  outlineTag: 
